{"language":"cn","values":[["/names/cn","悉达"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名生存欲望强烈的游侠，会在敌人身上寄生“吮噬心核”并吸取宿主的生命和能量。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","发现养分，准备吸取"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","I am eager for nourishment."],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","有所成长"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","How I flourish."],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","成为养分吧"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","Nourish me."],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","暂时休眠……"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_i18n/en","Slumber comes."],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","吸取了很多养分"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_i18n/en","Mmm, I am sated."],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","一直生长吧"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/transcript_i18n/en","Eternal growth."],["/unit_voice_lines/5/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","休眠……结束"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","My slumber. Ends."],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","这些养分，够吗？"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","Are these morsels enough to sustain me?"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","嗯，都很灵活"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","Oh yes, they're quite limber."],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","养分，很棒，可以成长。"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","不错的养分。"],["/affinity_gift_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","无法吸收，保持距离。"],["/mystical_house_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","土地，生存，长大……"],["/mystical_house_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","扩张，成长，扩张……"],["/mystical_house_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","能量，吸收，成长"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","悉达并没有强烈的情感，唯一的欲望只有——生存。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","如果要论耐心，全世界恐怕都没有能与悉达相提并论的生物——事实上，她也并没有烦躁这种情绪。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","悉达不喜欢太冷、太暖、太晒、太暗、太干燥、太潮湿的天气，但这并不意味着她无法在这些气候下生存。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","一个不为人知的秘密——悉达的视力和听力没有任何问题，但她几乎不依赖视觉和听觉的感官。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","通常来说，和悉达对话无法得到任何回应。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","悉达不需要水分，但给她浇普通的清水，确实会让她感到舒畅。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","悉达在习性上也更接近植物——除非是寻求养分而不得不出击，否则她可以在同一个地方默默生活几百年而纹丝不动，直到养分耗尽。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","需要提示的是，悉达只渴望生存，但并不会繁衍，她的每个种子内部都是她自己的一部分，也是她重生的根基。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","在世界任何地方，任何年代，都存在着“猩红的藤蔓吞噬血肉”的传说，当然，那几乎都是悉达。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","如果愿意的话，悉达能在极端的神圣光芒或者地心的岩浆里，以种子的形式休眠数百年，直到适宜复苏的时候到来。"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","这里，温度，适中，准备播种……"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415664.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","悉达 & 哈拉克"]]}